Following user feedback:

- A new option for your quiz: create your own custom quiz list from the joyo kanji set. Your list must have at least four different kanji to be valid.

- Now in addition to reviewing Hiragana and Katakana, you can also review all Joyo Kanji;

- Quiz buttons have their boundaries delimited by a green rectangle to avoid ambiguity;

Leave your feedback in the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/843120/discussions/] discussions page[/url]
